43
00:04:06,547 --> 00:04:12,551
[SPEAKER_02]: They exist secondary to this material world that's the real measure of existence.

44
00:04:12,571 --> 00:04:14,532
[SPEAKER_02]: Same with one's feelings, for example.

45
00:04:14,592 --> 00:04:19,895
[SPEAKER_02]: Intentions are generally like, oh, there's just some movement of some energies and whatnot.

46
00:04:20,015 --> 00:04:22,477
[SPEAKER_02]: But the real reality is, you know, the measurable

47
00:04:22,960 --> 00:04:27,964
