88
00:07:39,378 --> 00:07:45,923
[SPEAKER_02]: In other words, you step from whatever is currently absorbing you, you unabsorb yourself from it to gain perspective.

89
00:07:46,564 --> 00:07:49,326
[SPEAKER_02]: And that, he didn't, I mean, he took it

