00:08:44,355 --> 00:08:45,236
[SPEAKER_02]: Concurrent to what?

102
00:08:45,736 --> 00:08:49,420
[SPEAKER_02]: Well, concurrent to yourself being unabsorbed from whatever is trying to absorb you.

103
00:08:50,261 --> 00:08:53,124
[SPEAKER_02]: And your attention is always going to be resting on something.

104
00:08:54,305 --> 00:09:01,132
