00:11:56,483 --> 00:11:58,964
[SPEAKER_02]: You might not know... you might not see the implications of it.

150
00:11:59,364 --> 00:12:08,368
[SPEAKER_02]: But by practicing yoniso manasikāra correctly, you are also stepping back, as I described, from the pressure, which

151
00:12:11,258 --> 00:12:12,919
