170
00:13:31,737 --> 00:13:34,381
[SPEAKER_02]: It's because it requires lack of perspective.

171
00:13:34,441 --> 00:13:36,163
[SPEAKER_02]: It requires ayoniso.

172
00:13:37,465 --> 00:13:42,452
